      "content": "i know i should ask my doc but they're totally impossible to reach after hours and im dying to get some sleep. i feel like it's just a regular cough, nothing serious. is there a specific reason why it would be bad? like is there some huge risk or is it just a \"better safe than sorry\" kind of thing?",
