    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so i just checked the label on the bottle and it says it's just a standard dose. i've taken dextromethorphan before without any issues. i really dont want to wait until tomorrow morning to deal with this cough, it's making it impossible to rest. could you just tell me if a single dose of the syrup is generally considered safe with 50mg of sertraline? i just need some reassurance so i can get some sleep.",
